msgid ""
"[Billing a day care month](facturation.md) — what the verdict changes on the"
" month."
msgstr ""
"[Facturer un mois de centre de jour](facturation.md) — ce que le verdict "
"change sur le mois."

#: ../../content/centre-de-jour/norme-personnel.md:121
msgid ""
"[Institutional allowance](../forfait/index.md) — the allowance of a rest "
"home, computed from its own staff."
msgstr ""
"[Forfait institutionnel](../forfait/index.md) — le forfait d'une maison de "
"repos, calculé à partir de son propre personnel."
